<!--
    Status-bar icon for the D21 grace foreground service (rewrite task U-8).

    A terminal window with a prompt caret and a command line — the same glyph
    the pre-rewrite client used for its session notification, so the mark a user
    already associates with "PocketShell is holding my session" is unchanged.

    Status-bar icons MUST be white-on-transparent (alpha only); Android
    re-tints them per system theme, so the fillColor is opaque white and the
    rest of the canvas is transparent. Authored at 24dp like the other
    notification small icons in this module.
-->
